  "abstract": "Covers the OpenAPI Overlay Specification version lines: 1.2 (current, pinned at 1.2.0), 1.1 (supported, 1.1.0) and 1.0 (legacy, upgraded from, 1.0.0); no preview is listed because the 1.3 milestone has no specification text. It teaches the Overlay, Info, Components, Action, Reusable Action and Reusable Action Reference Objects, the update, copy and remove semantics and recursive merge rules, RFC 9535 JSONPath targets, the 1.0 to 1.1 and 1.1 to 1.2 upgrades, validation against the Overlay JSON Schemas (the 1.2 schema is still unpublished and pinned to a work-in-progress commit), and safe application in pipelines. SKILL.md holds the invariants and workflow; references split out objects, recipes, versions and safety.",
